app/geo/cities.csv
  City coordinates and time zones derived from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/), licensed under
  CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: a subset of ~160 cities was selected,
  coordinates were rounded to 4 decimals, and 2 points (Toronto, Dubai) were replaced with Wikidata (CC0) values.

